WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A list is read. A sequence of related words leaves a pattern behind.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The list closes. The original page is gone. Only the report remains.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
An answer appears. A plausible word can be remembered even if it was not presented.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Two records: what was presented and what was reported. One should not replace the other.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
A laboratory result. Roediger and McDermott studied word lists in 1995, not all lives.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The source trail. Certainty is not a source. Read the study. Keep the original.
